    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >T<strong>rivia War</strong> is a fast-paced, local multiplayer trivia battle where knowledge is power\u2014and survival is everything. Battle your friends or take on the AI in a fight to the last brain standing! Answer questions correctly to unleash powerful attacks on your opponents, upgrade your weapons, and outsmart everyone to be the last one alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Answer, Attack, Survive</strong> \u2013 Correct answers let you unleash devastating attacks on your opponents. The more questions you nail, the stronger your arsenal becomes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-Player Local Multiplayer</strong> \u2013 Grab up to three friends and go head-to-head in this fast-paced trivia showdown. Play solo or team up in <strong>2v2 mode</strong> for even more strategic fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Modes for Maximum Mayhem</strong> \u2013 Play on your terms with customizable options like <strong>Immunity Mode</strong>, where the fastest answerer becomes immune to attacks, or <strong>One Shot Kill Mode</strong>, where a single hit spells defeat. Adjust health and damage for your perfect level of chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Remote Play Together</strong> \u2013 Bring the battle online! Play with friends far and wide via Steam\u2019s Remote Play Together for seamless multiplayer fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Avatars &amp; Themes</strong> \u2013 Choose from quirky, adorable avatars and switch up the entire game\u2019s look with over a dozen vibrant themes. Make your trivia battle as unique as you are!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Combat</strong> \u2013 Trivia isn't just about answering questions\u2014it's about strategy. Answer quickly to launch attacks, but don\u2019t forget: wrong answers can leave you wide open for counterattacks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replayability</strong> \u2013 With tons of customizable settings, fun modes, and a variety of avatars and battle themes, each match feels fresh and exciting.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will your knowledge be enough to defeat your friends and reign supreme in Trivia War?</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >T<strong>rivia War</strong> is a fast-paced, local multiplayer trivia battle where knowledge is power\u2014and survival is everything. Battle your friends or take on the AI in a fight to the last brain standing! Answer questions correctly to unleash powerful attacks on your opponents, upgrade your weapons, and outsmart everyone to be the last one alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Answer, Attack, Survive</strong> \u2013 Correct answers let you unleash devastating attacks on your opponents. The more questions you nail, the stronger your arsenal becomes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-Player Local Multiplayer</strong> \u2013 Grab up to three friends and go head-to-head in this fast-paced trivia showdown. Play solo or team up in <strong>2v2 mode</strong> for even more strategic fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Modes for Maximum Mayhem</strong> \u2013 Play on your terms with customizable options like <strong>Immunity Mode</strong>, where the fastest answerer becomes immune to attacks, or <strong>One Shot Kill Mode</strong>, where a single hit spells defeat. Adjust health and damage for your perfect level of chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Remote Play Together</strong> \u2013 Bring the battle online! Play with friends far and wide via Steam\u2019s Remote Play Together for seamless multiplayer fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Avatars &amp; Themes</strong> \u2013 Choose from quirky, adorable avatars and switch up the entire game\u2019s look with over a dozen vibrant themes. Make your trivia battle as unique as you are!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Combat</strong> \u2013 Trivia isn't just about answering questions\u2014it's about strategy. Answer quickly to launch attacks, but don\u2019t forget: wrong answers can leave you wide open for counterattacks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replayability</strong> \u2013 With tons of customizable settings, fun modes, and a variety of avatars and battle themes, each match feels fresh and exciting.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will your knowledge be enough to defeat your friends and reign supreme in Trivia War?</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "The ultimate trivia showdown! Compete against friends or the CPU in a high-stakes contest where answering questions isn\u2019t just about being right\u2014it\u2019s about survival! Each correct answer lets you attack opponents and upgrade your weapon. Be the last player standing in this fast paced trivia brawl!",
